{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"zenabus-net-night","version":1,"title":"Zenabu’s Net Night","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"It was bedtime. The moon was out. Zenabu got into bed with her teddy.","sentences":["It was bedtime.","The moon was out.","Zenabu got into bed with her teddy."],"alt":"A girl in a nightdress climbs into bed with a teddy.","image":{"hash":"sha256:560de382c73534b5d4af46e6b812da47ae3f7bc38239977b4d5ab79e01425946","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d09dbb2f7fec604e49bdcd7992aaada4d0eb2015b7b5f0dc246379aff08a6b74","durationMs":10760,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2613],[2613,5397],[5397,10760]],"words":[[0,344],[344,859],[859,2613],[2613,3128],[3128,3816],[3816,4332],[4332,5397],[5397,6428],[6428,6944],[6944,7632],[7632,8147],[8147,8835],[8835,9351],[9351,10760]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Then she heard it. Zzzz, zzzz! A mosquito! ‘I will hide under my blanket,’ said Zenabu.","sentences":["Then she heard it.","Zzzz, zzzz!","A mosquito!","‘I will hide under my blanket,’ said Zenabu."],"alt":"A girl peeks from under a blanket as a tiny mosquito flies near.","image":{"hash":"sha256:ece6d16149162184700e77e1a3473fbb632d2d06f7c3302da854a450a93040cd","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d697384f666da8fa3852d1bfd86d6409c43a1f6e43102f3a7119dedcab12ea53","durationMs":16200,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3483],[3483,6075],[6075,8546],[8546,16200]],"words":[[0,810],[810,1418],[1418,2430],[2430,3483],[3483,4617],[4617,6075],[6075,6277],[6277,8546],[8546,8748],[8748,9558],[9558,10368],[10368,11380],[11380,11785],[11785,13527],[13527,14337],[14337,16200]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"‘Wait,’ said Mama. ‘Mosquitoes bite at night. Some carry germs that make people ill with malaria. We have a better way.’","sentences":["‘Wait,’ said Mama.","‘Mosquitoes bite at night.","Some carry germs that make people ill with malaria.","We have a better way.’"],"alt":"A mother holds up a folded white net in the bedroom.","image":{"hash":"sha256:ee38dc4332fd762b65470ea7189885a69ca6af5318331b80fb2ee9d7a4212376","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:8d1ca100a9943bd56aa3e54f2145398c5d09beff2ae8017d9448d5c8c81e15c5","durationMs":14920,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2378],[2378,5804],[5804,12202],[12202,14920]],"words":[[0,793],[793,1359],[1359,2378],[2378,3794],[3794,4360],[4360,4643],[4643,5804],[5804,6370],[6370,7078],[7078,7786],[7786,8352],[8352,8918],[8918,9767],[9767,10192],[10192,10758],[10758,12202],[12202,12485],[12485,13051],[13051,13193],[13193,14042],[14042,14920]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Mama hung the net over the bed. It was like a soft, white tent. ‘This is your mosquito net,’ she said.","sentences":["Mama hung the net over the bed.","It was like a soft, white tent.","‘This is your mosquito net,’ she said."],"alt":"A mother hangs a white net like a tent over a bed.","image":{"hash":"sha256:65c0f5768114eb1a81cf1f0071adc47683849340d9e4149f873f6cd4c196ab6c","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:fc726602b0e89e9b8be31ae9898fd939955e6c2795e4ace327384ac2ac6fd755","durationMs":12720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3941],[3941,7968],[7968,12720]],"words":[[0,579],[579,1159],[1159,1594],[1594,2028],[2028,2608],[2608,3042],[3042,3941],[3941,4230],[4230,4665],[4665,5244],[5244,5389],[5389,6201],[6201,6925],[6925,7968],[7968,8548],[8548,8837],[8837,9417],[9417,10576],[10576,11242],[11242,11677],[11677,12720]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Mama tucked the edges under the mattress. ‘No gaps,’ she said. ‘No holes. Then the mosquito cannot get in.’","sentences":["Mama tucked the edges under the mattress.","‘No gaps,’ she said.","‘No holes.","Then the mosquito cannot get in.’"],"alt":"A mother tucks the edges of a net under a mattress.","image":{"hash":"sha256:3d3bf12f2ce0